  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: ec6039b4-cf22-46bc-b078-d97dca4202b2
    DialogueText: Where you do want them? Keep in mind you'll have to provide a bed for this employee.
    DialogueNodeLabel: SELECT_LOCATION
    Position: {x: 1106, y: 487}
    choices: []
    VoiceLine: 6
  - Guid: 62eba995-844b-444a-b740-75de8dd4c4e5
    DialogueText: I can help you with that. What sort of employee are you looking for?
    DialogueNodeLabel: ENTRY
    Position: {x: 442, y: 374}
    choices:
    - Guid: cc771db7-17c7-4ee1-bedc-8402a074652b
      ChoiceText: Cleaner (picking up trash, emptying trash cans)
      ChoiceLabel: Cleaner
    - Guid: b63b331b-15ba-4e2e-a1fd-eb0878ee47ac
      ChoiceText: Botanist (planting, plant maintenance, harvesting)
      ChoiceLabel: Botanist
    - Guid: 924e88be-1e34-4c6e-ab57-d6429692c222
      ChoiceText: Packager (packaging, moving items)
      ChoiceLabel: Packager
    - Guid: 6194aa23-82b1-48dc-8ee3-d27f0a81b8b7
      ChoiceText: Chemist (chemistry station, lab oven, cauldron, mixing station)
      ChoiceLabel: Chemist
    VoiceLine: 0
  - Guid: 52f71dd8-ff10-4aa3-913f-47c539acc9a8
    DialogueText: That'll be a <SIGN_FEE> signing free, and the employee's daily wage will be <DAILY_WAGE>.
    DialogueNodeLabel: FINALIZE
    Position: {x: 1679, y: 525}
    choices:
    - Guid: 3321a527-4d93-4ff2-b353-cb9c564bb3c0
      ChoiceText: Deal
      ChoiceLabel: CONFIRM
    - Guid: 40720aab-a49e-49d1-8e13-0ff0fd53967a
      ChoiceText: Nevermind
      ChoiceLabel:
    VoiceLine: 0
  - Guid: 326b957e-c2c4-4b36-82df-07f737730eb5
    DialogueText: Cheers. I'll send your new employee over to your property now.
    DialogueNodeLabel:
    Position: {x: 2709, y: 380}
    choices: []
    VoiceLine: 3
  - Guid: 0c3a763a-0619-47db-ae92-fdd19977078a
    DialogueText: Cheers. I'll send your new employee over to your property now. I'm also giving you a clipboard, which you can use to manage your employees and equipment.
    DialogueNodeLabel:
    Position: {x: 2709, y: 654}
    choices: []
    VoiceLine: 0
